        <mxCell id="text_25" value="&lt;div&gt;Narrow permission: 12 directed pairs / 28 imported symbols, recomputed from the application.&lt;br/&gt;Mapper constructors/factory, stored-value properties and enum serialization; terminal/active SQL constants.&lt;br/&gt;Simulator: OnlineOption contract and .value logging. No workflow, pricing, refund or transaction decision in&lt;br/&gt;DAOs.&lt;br/&gt;Solid open arrow = runtime responsibility; dashed open arrow = admitted source dependency.&lt;br/&gt;Projection only: exact module/symbol/use details are in policy.json + symbol_use_review.json +&lt;br/&gt;dependency_overlay.json.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=34;fontColor=#202B36;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
